# c01-absolute-anchor: section 7 C01 (H1/H3/H7) and the section 6.1 absolute anchor
exit ok
frame 625/0/1
digest-anchor
count tickAttempts 0
count suppressedTicks 0
count emittedTickFrames 0
count publicUpdateAttempts 1
count publicUpdateSuccesses 1
count frameCount 1
require host.command index=1 line=3 verb=seek outcome=ok
# NOTE (source line numbers): the task table spelled this as line=2 because it counted the
# program without the header comment that names the case. The header comment is source line 1,
# the open is line 2 and the seek is line 3. Section 3.5 and 3.6.1 define line= as the source
# line number, so this fixture uses 3. If the host numbers only effective commands, use 2.
# NOTE (runner): require takes one literal substring, but the case runner keeps only the token
# after the directive, so this assertion is currently truncated to "host.command".
